{"unit_id":"RINGOLINK__dsh-desktop-shell#card-zh","repo":"RINGOLINK/dsh-desktop-shell","commit":"e5eb39fe9e056b36777ab931334aeae7221c5dbe","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-shell 是面向 DSH Web profile 的 Windows 桌面外壳插件。它把 DSH Web UI 放进独立的 WebView2 窗口，并在系统托盘常驻；宿主启动时可自动部署便携启动器，设置页提供安装或修复、快捷方式重建、登录自启开关、清理和后端重启。启动器还支持调试模式与接管外部后端。适合希望像桌面应用一样打开 DSH 的 Windows 用户；需要 Windows x64、Node.js、DSH 和 WebView2 Runtime。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:352-373","lib/client.js:28-48","lib/install.js:70-99"]}
{"unit_id":"RINGOLINK__dsh-desktop-shell#card-en","repo":"RINGOLINK/dsh-desktop-shell","commit":"e5eb39fe9e056b36777ab931334aeae7221c5dbe","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-desktop-shell turns the DSH Web UI into a Windows desktop app. It opens a standalone WebView2 window with tray residency. The settings row supports installation, shortcut repair, opt-in sign-in startup, cleanup, and backend restart. Requires Windows, DSH, Node.js, and WebView2 Runtime.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:352-373","lib/client.js:28-48","lib/install.js:70-99"]}
